# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
# Prometheus Operator's ServiceMonitor path: Prometheus scrapes the lab Service and remote-writes
# it to the same in-cluster receiver used by the Alloy permutations. This changes the collector
# envelope, not the metric-family catalogue.
PERMUTATION_TITLE="Prometheus Operator ServiceMonitor remote-write envelope"
PERMUTATION_SUMMARY="kube-prometheus-stack scrapes the lab-catalog ServiceMonitor and remote-writes its Prometheus-shaped metrics."
PERMUTATION_COLLECTOR="prometheus-community/kube-prometheus-stack"
PERMUTATION_COLLECTOR_VERSION="88.6.2"
PERMUTATION_CORPUS_AREAS="k8s"
PERMUTATION_CAPTURE_STATUS="proven"
PERMUTATION_DEVIATIONS="The remote-write target is the in-cluster capture receiver rather than Grafana Cloud, so its temporary certificate is accepted without verification.|Only the lab-catalog ServiceMonitor is selected; bundled kube-prometheus-stack exporters are disabled to isolate the ServiceMonitor envelope.|Alertmanager and Grafana are disabled because neither participates in the collector-egress shape under capture."
